// IntroString :
"P4123470892" "I just received word through Longbow secure channels that they are closing in on an Arachnos covert ops team operating in the area. From what it sounds like, the Arachnos force is vastly outnumbered and is going to face capture.<br><br>Let's give our friends in Arachnos a bit of backup, shall we? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the office where the conflict is going on and provide relief for the Arachnos force. Huntsman Davros must survive!</A><br><br>You have 75 minutes before Longbow overwhelms the Arachnos force."
// AcceptString :
"P2573987973" "Provide backup for Arachnos"
// SendOffString :
"P3644540537" "Am I jeopardizing my fellow Longbow agents? Yes. Do I care? No."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1150814505" "Rescue Huntsman Davros"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4008711890" "Head over there, will you? The Arachnos forces can't hold out for long."

