// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3615195491" "The Longbow and Wyvern forces sometime come into conflict since Longbow adheres to the letter of the law while Wyvern sometimes breaks the rules. We can use this to our advantage by playing each against the other.<br><br>Longbow has been tracking the import of illegal goods into Sharkhead from Paragon City, and is looking at making a bust very soon. In the meantime, Wyvern is often bringing in goods to support temporary bases all over the Rogue Islands. I've falsified a shipping manifest that implicates the Wyvern cargo ship in the import of the illegal goods.  <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Plant the manifest on the Wyvern cargo ship.</A> Once you do that, I'll send in Longbow agents to bust some Wyvern heads."
// AcceptString :
"P2477837965" "Plant manifest on cargo ship"
// SendOffString :
"P3742993496" "This is going to be a great way to promote distrust between Longbow and Wyvern."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4026508721" "Hurry up! The cargo ship is at the docks already."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2121155951" "The cargo ship sways gently in the water."

